ce coming in and  you're much more likely to see if you  find that you don't really know enough  about the business yet and you really  want to make sure you have a stable  income while you're building your  business thing you can do is go work for  a company that you respect so you know  going to get a job isn't the end of the  world as long as you can learn from it  so go find a company who you want to be  like so a small fashion design house  where you can go and learn the ropes of  the business you can start your business  on the side be making money from your  job I'm  some important industry contacts to help  you when you do grow your business and  you learn as much as you can about the  actual business itself by working in  that type of company so don't get a job  just to make money get a job to actually  learn something that will help you  eventually grow your business so I  wouldn't count on the banks and summary  we encounter the banks has a good source  unless you have really good personal  credit I try to boost up my business on  the start so go try to make some sales  talk to customers talk to potential  retailers and boutique shops and get  them to make a purchase decision based  off your sketch or maybe a sample and if  you really need cash to kind of get  started then thought trying to find a  job with somebody who you respect in  your industry that you can learn a lot  from before you start your business and  then circuit business on the side so  hopefully that helps Julie if you guys  like the video please give it a thumbs  up below it's what makes me want to keep  making more of these videos for you guys  and if you have other thoughts for Julie  as well feel free to leave a comment  under the video a lot of seeing those  come in and we'll see you on the next  episode  you
 

